DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26699::$$$message_0198_0000_0000$$$::"...It's not like I need to talk urgently."[lr]::
26700::$$$message_0198_0000_0001$$$::I've already finished the prep for tomorrow, so I can chat during breakfast.[lr]::
26701::$$$message_0198_0000_0002$$$::I ready a towel and change of clothes, and head for the bath.[lr]::
26702::$$$message_0198_0000_0003$$$::I'll wash off my sweat before I sleep.::
26703::$$$message_0198_0001_0000$$$::When I go to check the living room, nobody is there.[lr]::
26704::$$$message_0198_0001_0001$$$::The lights are still on, so someone must still be using it.::
26705::$$$message_0198_0002_0000$$$::"Ah, Senpai... Good evening."[lr]::
26706::$$$message_0198_0002_0001$$$::I pass Sakura in the hall.[lr]::
26707::$$$message_0198_0002_0002$$$::We just saw each other, so the greeting strikes me as a little odd.::
26708::$$$message_0198_0003_0000$$$::"Evening. Oh, is someone using the bath?"[lr]::
26709::$$$message_0198_0003_0001$$$::"No, I don't think so. [cacheimage storage=桜私服04a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=桜私服04a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Rider said there was something she wanted to watch on TV at 10 o'clock, and I think Saber is still in her room."::
26710::$$$message_0198_0004_0000$$$::So Rider turned the lights on. Saber's still in her room, apparently, so the bath must be empty...[lr]::
26711::$$$message_0198_0004_0001$$$::...Hold on. If Sakura's here, then...::
26712::$$$message_0198_0005_0000$$$::"Sakura, were you about to take a bath?"[lr]::
26713::$$$message_0198_0005_0001$$$::"Aha, could you tell?[lr]::
26714::$$$message_0198_0005_0002$$$::Um, Rider and the others take a long time in the bath, so I was hoping to use it first."::
26715::$$$message_0198_0006_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. Rider has all that hair to take care of, after all.[lr]::
26716::$$$message_0198_0006_0001$$$::Okay. Go ahead."[lr]::
26717::$$$message_0198_0006_0002$$$::"But it sounds like you were about to use it."[lr]::
26718::$$$message_0198_0006_0003$$$::"I can do that whenever. I'll just go kill some time in the shed."::
26719::$$$message_0198_0007_0000$$$::"Y-you shouldn't do that! Don't mind me. Please use the bath first!"[lr]::
26720::$$$message_0198_0007_0001$$$::"I said it's fine. You got here first. Early bird gets the worm."::
26721::$$$message_0198_0008_0000$$$::"No, [font italic=true]I'm[font italic=false] fine. I don't mind using the bath second at all!"[lr]::
26722::$$$message_0198_0008_0001$$$::"I am telling you I don't mind either. Also, what if Rider comes in after me? You won't be able to take a bath until 11 o'clock."::
26723::$$$message_0198_0009_0000$$$::"I-I'm fine with that. I'm even okay waiting a little longer for Saber!"[lr]::
26724::$$$message_0198_0009_0001$$$::"Yeah, but..."[lr]::
26725::$$$message_0198_0009_0002$$$::Neither of us are giving any ground. What a weird situation.::
26726::$$$message_0198_0010_0000$$$::"No ifs, ands, or buts.[lr]::
26727::$$$message_0198_0010_0001$$$::You're the head of the household, so please feel free to use the bath!"[lr]::
26728::$$$message_0198_0010_0002$$$::"Well, that makes you a guest. You should feel free to take a bath, too."::
26729::$$$message_0198_0011_0000$$$::We're at a stalemate.[lr]::
26730::$$$message_0198_0011_0001$$$::"Wai[line len=2]Sakura!"[lr]::
26731::$$$message_0198_0011_0002$$$::She pushes me toward the entrance to the bath.[lr]::
26732::$$$message_0198_0011_0003$$$::Urgh, Sakura is getting pretty worked up.::
26733::$$$message_0198_0012_0000$$$::"Ngh! Argh, this wouldn't happen if we had separate baths for each gender."[lr]::
26734::$$$message_0198_0012_0001$$$::I voice a pipe dream that you'd never see in a regular residence.[lr]::
26735::$$$message_0198_0012_0002$$$::This house is needlessly big, but that just sounds excessive.::
26736::$$$message_0198_0013_0000$$$::"Ah... Y-yeah. It would be nice if the guesthouse had its own bath..."[lr]::
26737::$$$message_0198_0013_0001$$$::"We could put the women's bath over there, and make the current bath for men... Oh, but it would double the cleaning work, and the guest bath would be cramped."::
26738::$$$message_0198_0014_0000$$$::I'd be the only one to take advantage of the men's bath, too. I should just bear with it.[lr]::
26739::$$$message_0198_0014_0001$$$::More importantly, this isn't helping us to decide on who's going to use the bath first.::
26740::$$$message_0198_0015_0000$$$::"Man, now that it's come to this..."[lr]::
26741::$$$message_0198_0015_0001$$$::"U-um, Senpai!? What's wrong?"[lr]::
26742::$$$message_0198_0015_0002$$$::I grab Sakura's hand instead, [clfg time=300 pos=all rule=シャッター左から textoff=0]and pull her along.::
26743::$$$message_0198_0016_0000$$$::"S-Senpai, are you..."[lr]::
26744::$$$message_0198_0016_0001$$$::"Sakura..."[lr]::
26745::$$$message_0198_0016_0002$$$::"Are you...[wvl][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-3]coming in with me!?"::
26746::$$$message_0198_0017_0000$$$::Eh?[lr]::
26747::$$$message_0198_0017_0001$$$::W-what is Sakura saying while blushing!?::
26748::$$$message_0198_0018_0000$$$::"It might be a little cramped for two, [cacheimage storage=桜私服12a頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服12a頬(中) textoff=0]but I could take a bath with you... [cacheimage storage=桜私服05f頬(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服05f頬(中) textoff=0]Ah, should I go get my swimsuit!?"::
26749::$$$message_0198_0019_0000$$$::Well, it would be better than bathing together naked.::
26750::$$$message_0198_0020_0000$$$::"But what about you...[cacheimage storage=桜私服10d頬(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10d頬(中) textoff=0] Oh you can wear a swimsuit, too, [cacheimage storage=桜私服08k(中)][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08k(中) textoff=0]and if Rider or Saber sees us, we can just say that you were teaching me to swim... [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Yeah!"::
26751::$$$message_0198_0021_0000$$$::Should I praise her for the inspired idea?[lr]::
26752::$$$message_0198_0021_0001$$$::Still, why would we be practicing swimming in the bathtub... [chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服12d頬(中) textoff=0]I think even reading a textbook would be more helpful.[lr]::
26753::$$$message_0198_0021_0002$$$::While it would be interesting to let Sakura's imagination run wild, [chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服02b頬(中) textoff=0]I need to explain.::
26754::$$$message_0198_0022_0000$$$::"...It's not like that, Sakura.[lr]::
26755::$$$message_0198_0022_0001$$$::You wouldn't budge, so I was going to push you inside and then leave."[lr]::
26756::$$$message_0198_0022_0002$$$::"Huh? Really? But..."[lr]::
26757::$$$message_0198_0022_0003$$$::"At this point, nobody's going to take a bath.[lr]::
26758::$$$message_0198_0022_0004$$$::I'll heat it up again later, so just use it first like you normally would."::
26759::$$$message_0198_0023_0000$$$::That's that. I leave the washroom.[lr]::
26760::$$$message_0198_0023_0001$$$::At this rate, we'll actually end up bathing together in swimsuits, so this is fine.::
26761::$$$message_0198_0024_0000$$$::"Oh... I'm sorry. Then I'll borrow the bath first."[lr]::
26762::$$$message_0198_0024_0001$$$::"Yeah. Enjoy."::
26763::$$$message_0198_0025_0000$$$::With that, I go back to the living room.[lr]::
26764::$$$message_0198_0025_0001$$$::I finish washing the dishes and sit with Rider in front of the TV to pass the time.[lr]::
26765::$$$message_0198_0025_0002$$$::Rider is watching the news.::
26766::$$$message_0198_0026_0000$$$::"Is Sakura taking a bath?"[lr]::
26767::$$$message_0198_0026_0001$$$::"Yeah. We had a little argument over who would go first."[lr]::
26768::$$$message_0198_0026_0002$$$::"You both tried to let the other go first? [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服04a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服04a(中)]...Heh. If Rin was here, she would've just taken advantage of you to use it first."::
26769::$$$message_0198_0027_0000$$$::"I bet... You could've gone in while we were arguing, though."[lr]::
26770::$$$message_0198_0027_0001$$$::"I don't mind being last. I just need to turn off the gas at the end, right?"::
26771::$$$message_0198_0028_0000$$$::Rider's the type to let others go first, huh?[lr]::
26772::$$$message_0198_0028_0001$$$::Modesty is a good virtue to have, but these two are so alike.::
26773::$$$message_0198_0029_0000$$$::"Haah, thanks for letting me take a bath first. It was a nice bath, Senpai."[lr]::
26774::$$$message_0198_0029_0001$$$::"Oh, you're done. Welcome...back."[lr]::
26775::$$$message_0198_0029_0002$$$::Sakura comes into the living room, fresh out of the bath.[lr]::
26776::$$$message_0198_0029_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
26777::$$$message_0198_0029_0004$$$::...I let my guard down.[lr]::
26778::$$$message_0198_0029_0005$$$::She looks softer than usual, and she's giving off a sweet scent.::
26779::$$$message_0198_0030_0000$$$::"I'm sorry. It took a while to wash my hair. You both had to wait for me, so I shouldn't have taken such a long time..."[lr]::
26780::$$$message_0198_0030_0001$$$::"No, I think baths are best enjoyed at your leisure.[lr]::
26781::$$$message_0198_0030_0002$$$::Sakura, your hair is still... Should I brush it out for you?"::
26782::$$$message_0198_0031_0000$$$::"Ah...yeah. Please, Rider. I'll brush yours too, once you're finished."::
26783::$$$message_0198_0032_0000$$$::I watch them interact.[lr]::
26784::$$$message_0198_0032_0001$$$::From here, they look like sisters who get along well.[wm canskip=0]::
26785::$$$message_0198_0033_0000$$$::"Senpai?"[lr]::
26786::$$$message_0198_0033_0001$$$::"Huh? Oh no, I spaced out... You must be thirsty after the bath. Want something to drink?"::
26787::$$$message_0198_0034_0000$$$::"Ah, the caffeine in tea will keep me awake... Do you have any tomato juice?"[lr]::
26788::$$$message_0198_0034_0001$$$::"Yeah, we have plenty since we use it for cooking. Hang on."::
26789::$$$message_0198_0035_0000$$$::I go to the kitchen.[lr]::
26790::$$$message_0198_0035_0001$$$::Unless I get some water, I'm not gonna be able to quench this thirst.::
26791::$$$message_0198_0036_0000$$$::I'll cut some celery as a snack [se storage=se244.wav]to help myself calm down, too.::
26792::$$$message_0198_0037_0000$$$::...Sakura looked so sexy after getting out of the bath. I try to focus on the kitchen knife.[lr]::
26793::$$$message_0198_0037_0001$$$::I'm [font italic=true]still[font italic=false] hot and bothered, so I cut some cucumbers into sticks, too.[lr]::
26794::$$$message_0198_0037_0002$$$::...Good grief.[lr]::
26795::$$$message_0198_0037_0003$$$::I'd better cool myself off after this and sleep.::
26796::$$$message_0198_0038_0000$$$::"Thanks for waiting. I cut a bunch of snacks, too."[lr]::
26797::$$$message_0198_0038_0001$$$::"Wh-what happened, Senpai!?"[lr]::
26798::$$$message_0198_0038_0002$$$::"Shirou...what is this?"[lr]::
26799::$$$message_0198_0038_0003$$$::"Well, I thought you'd want something to go with the tomato[line len=2][wvl][shock vmax=15 time=1000 count=18] Huh!?!?"::
26800::$$$message_0198_0039_0000$$$::I realize what's wrong with the tray.[lr]::
26801::$$$message_0198_0039_0001$$$::It's piled high with greens. Not just a glass, but a bowl full of vegetables cut into sticks.[lr]::
26802::$$$message_0198_0039_0002$$$::"Oh no, I cut too much..."[lr]::
26803::$$$message_0198_0039_0003$$$::"I thought you were taking a while just to get tomato juice... [cacheimage storage=桜私服03e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服03e(中) time=300 textoff=0]R-Rider, do you want some of this?"[lr]::
26804::$$$message_0198_0039_0004$$$::"I'll take some... Should I call Saber?[lr]::
26805::$$$message_0198_0039_0005$$$::I'm sure she could clean this up quickly."::
26806::$$$message_0198_0040_0000$$$::"It's okay. We can use the leftovers for breakfast tomorrow.[lr]::
26807::$$$message_0198_0040_0001$$$::How about you, Senpai?"[lr]::
26808::$$$message_0198_0040_0002$$$::"Urgh, later. I'm going to take a bath first."[lr]::
26809::$$$message_0198_0040_0003$$$::"Okay. Enjoy!"::
26810::$$$message_0198_0041_0000$$$::What's wrong with me?[lr]::
26811::$$$message_0198_0041_0001$$$::I'd better bathe, calm myself down, and snack on some veggies...::
926745::$$$message_9198_0016_0002$$$::"Are you...coming in with me!?"[r]::

